Book for a special preview of Dune: Part Three in IMAX 70mm
Thank you for signing up to hear when tickets are released for Dune: Part Three.

We're excited to share that we will be screening two special previews of the film
on Tuesday 15 December 2026, three days ahead of global opening weekend on Friday
18 December 2026. These screenings have extremely limited availability so we
suggest booking as soon as you can to avoid missing out.

We will be releasing tickets for Friday 18 December and beyond in due course so
keep your eyes peeled for a follow up email this autumn.

